      "detail_url": "https://e-catalogs.taat-africa.org/com/technologies/sre-seed-requirement-estimation-tool-for-sweetpotato",
      "image_url": "https://e-catalogs.taat-africa.org/images/preview/RP1wydvhnXMwb1i77OLpQPpuyYBDfdbiIwA3DOIr.png",
      "abstract": "Optimize Seed Supply with SRE!The SRE Tool is a business planning aid for seed enterprises. It forecasts seed demand, aligns production with market size, and prevents over- or under-supply—improving profitability and attracting investment.",
      "inventor": "SRE",
      "title": "Seed Requirement Estimation Tool for Sweetpotato",
      "pubdate": "Last updated on 29 September 2025",
      "full_description": [
        "Optimize Seed Supply with SRE!",
        "The SRE Tool provides enterprise-level seed planning through a web-based platform, generating production calendars, land requirements, and input needs across all seed classes (tissue culture to QDS). It integrates rapid multiplication technologies and allows customization of production roles and assumptions, helping seed enterprises optimize resources, align output with market demand, and reduce financial risks."
