        "Sustainable Development Goal 13: climate action",
        "Sustainable Development Goal 15: life on land",
        "Sustainable Development Goal 17: partnerships for the goals"
      ],
      "readiness_level": 9,
      "adoption_level": 7
    },
    {
      "detail_url": "https://e-catalogs.taat-africa.org/com/technologies/seedtracker-digital-tool-for-strengthening-seed-governance-and-certification-systems",
      "image_url": "https://e-catalogs.taat-africa.org/images/preview/H9NreYaPllkwbQPJESHLMaMDQg5ZqVWgxZEe6gsG.jpg",
      "abstract": "Build an efficient seed system!SeedTracker is a business-friendly digital tool that helps seed companies and entrepreneurs manage, certify, and market high-quality seed. It improves traceability, inventory tracking, and connects producers with buyers—all through a secure and easy-to-use digital platform.",
      "inventor": "SeedTracker",
      "title": "Digital Tool for Strengthening Seed Governance and Certification Systems",
      "pubdate": "Last updated on 27 May 2025",
      "full_description": [
        "Build an efficient seed system!",
        "The platform enables producers to register seed fields and seed lots, request inspections, and access certification results digitally. Businesses can monitor production progress, manage inventory in real time, and use the platform to connect with clients looking for specific varieties. SeedTracker works offline and protects user data with secure logins, making it suitable for rural business operations."
      ],
      "sdgs": [
        "Sustainable Development Goal 2: zero hunger",
        "Sustainable Development Goal 5: gender equality",
        "Sustainable Development Goal 13: climate action",
        "Sustainable Development Goal 17: partnerships for the goals"
      ],
      "readiness_level": 9,
      "adoption_level": 7
    },
    {
      "detail_url": "https://e-catalogs.taat-africa.org/com/technologies/cassava-egs-model-early-generation-seed-production-of-cassava",
      "image_url": "https://e-catalogs.taat-africa.org/images/preview/xgjYbFznXIK5TjVzouikmZvKGFhxvjtsP5ndpu0D.jpg",
      "abstract": "Breeder & Foundation Cassava Seeds—Always Within ReachThis technology enables seed companies and certified producers to multiply and supply breeder and foundation cassava seeds directly from research centers. It follows national seed certification standards, uses both in-house and outgrower schemes, and ensures that farmers and seed entrepreneurs get access to clean, high-quality planting material. Registration with seed authorities and proper field inspection are required for participation.",
      "inventor": "Cassava EGS Model",
      "title": "Early Generation Seed Production of Cassava",
      "pubdate": "Last updated on 30 June 2025",
      "full_description": [
        "Breeder & Foundation Cassava Seeds—Always Within Reach",
        "This model enables agribusinesses, commercial seed producers, and agro-dealers to access clean, improved cassava seeds directly from research centers. These companies multiply the seeds on their own farms or with outgrowers to produce certified breeder and foundation seeds. By following national seed standards and passing regular inspections, businesses can supply high-quality cassava seeds to farmers and seed sellers, building a reliable and profitable seed enterprise."
      ],
      "sdgs": [
        "Sustainable Development Goal 1: no poverty",
        "Sustainable Development Goal 2: zero hunger",
